        "background": "",
        "content": "<div class=\"indents\"><p>The question of how Portuguese ants founded a colony in the exurbs here fascinates us now ▤ the question of what was in the shipping containers that carried a fortunate handful of ants fascinates us now ▧ the question of what type of abdomen the jetliner piled high with clothing has fascinates us now ◯ the question of the business logic of a payment gateway which prepared the translation of figures to declare the pile of clothing fascinates us now ▲ the question of how the burst of sockets and requests which moves quicker than ants of course and has an overlay of a queen superimposed mainly on plateau continents and repeated again but still as one fascinates us now ◌ the question of getting to the one by proximity within an overlay fascinates us now ▣ the question of our volume of blood as a mansion in itself and possible to be cast and possible to be given over and possible to be connected to other mansions by means of what fascinates us now.</p></div>",
